45 ServiceName/ImagePath, 4104 ScriptBlockText, 4720/4732 accounts, Sysmon 1/3/11, Computer, Channel, Security UserID SID | gap (evtx-event-semantics; #27) | BinXML template + substitution array | stdlib BinXML walker or python-evtx `rec.xml()` (worker-only); `evtx_dump.py` (I) | high |\n| 157 | Cross-log synthesis: duplicated logs (same records, different names / hosts), the truncated or shortened copy, host (Computer) grouping, record-count / time-span order, merged timeline earliest/latest | gap (evtx-multi-log-synthesis) | several `.evtx` members; synthesis text \"duplicate\", \"host\", \"shortened\" | per-file #26/#155 fields + `lib.meta.synthesis` | med-high |\n| 158 | Event-log \"reports\": Event Viewer CSV / XML (`<Events><Event xmlns=...>`) / `wevtutil qe /f:text` / Get-WinEvent CSV exports and legacy `.evt` (`LfLe` @4, ELF_LOGFILE_HEADER, records with `LfLe` @4); record counts and id/time ranges from text vs binary | gap (eventlog-exports-legacy-evt) | `\"Level\",\"Date and Time\",\"Source\",\"Event ID\"` header; `<Events>`; `30 00 00 00 4c 66 4c 65` | csv / xml.etree / struct | med |\n| 159 | Windows ETW trace `.etl` (WMI_BUFFER_HEADER, TRACE_LOGFILE_HEADER: buffer size, start/end time, events lost, logger name, OS version) | gap (etl-etw-trace) | buffer header; `TRACE_LOGFILE_HEADER` in first buffer | struct | low-med |\n| 160 | Registry hive integrity + transaction logs: primary/secondary sequence mismatch (dirty hive), `.LOG1/.LOG2` (`DIRT`/HvLE log entries), hbin count vs hive bins data size, checksum @0x1FC | gap (regf-dirty-translogs) | `regf` seq1 @4 != seq2 @8; `HvLE` blocks | struct | med-high (D24 flavor analog for hives) |\n| 161 | $UsnJrnl:$J + Amcache/ShimCache execution evidence | gap (usn-journal-records, amcache-shimcache) | USN_RECORD_V2/V3; regf Amcache `Root\\\\InventoryApplicationFile`; SYSTEM AppCompatCache `10ts` | struct; regipy plugins (I, worker-only) | med-high |\n\"\"\"+s[j:]\n# recognition cue\nrep(\"45 6c 66 46 69 6c 65 00 (El